A decade later, ArtRage has mounted 54 exhibitions all within the mission to exhibit art that "promotes social awareness; supports social justice, challenges preconceptions and encourages cultural change." ArtRage has brought the work of nationally recognized artists to Syracuse such as social realist painter, Max Ginsberg, activist printmaker, Favianna Rodriguez and the Civil Rights Movement photographer Matt Herron.
